    # the generic Linux CI image. Same reason crates/fabric-gui/src-tauri is excluded.
    "crates/hwledger/apps/hwledger-app/src-tauri",
    # Agentora residue. It sits inside the repo, so cargo would otherwise assume it
    # belongs to this workspace and refuse to build it ("believes it's in a
    # workspace when it's not"). It is not integrated: it was absorbed from
    # zz-zz-agentcheck-zz-pause-Agentora as the 105 paths that neither PhenoShared
    # nor PhenoAI held.
    #
    # Verified 2026-11-12: the crate compiles standalone (`cargo check` exit 0) and
    # declares no workspace inheritance and no path dependencies, so promoting it to
    # a workspace member is feasible. It is deliberately left excluded for now
    # because adding a member changes Cargo.lock and needs a full workspace build to
    # validate against CI; that is a separate, build-gated step.
]
